{"id":"n41676-1-9","stage":2,"title":"눕히다 · 使躺","scene":"人物与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n41676-1-9-1","ko":"환자를 어디에 눕힐까요?","zh":"要把病人放在哪里呢？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"환자를","meaning":"患者，病人","explanation":"환자：患者，病人；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"환자","audio":"/audio/7780fb9b6e0ea5fdf5fa.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"31669","senseId":"1","lemma":"환자","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"어디에","meaning":"哪里，哪儿","explanation":"어디：哪里，哪儿；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"어디","audio":"/audio/c1ee1b7e560f9f3ac3bf.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60319","senseId":"1","lemma":"어디","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"눕힐까요?","meaning":"使躺，使平躺","explanation":"눕히다：使躺，使平躺；ㄹ까요：礼貌地询问意见、提出建议或推测：“要不要、会不会”。","readings":[{"term":"눕히다","audio":"/audio/51f77b0b4a29da93a20c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"41676","senseId":"1","lemma":"눕히다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"7780fb9b6e0ea5fd","term":"환자","zh":"患者，病人","audio":"/audio/7780fb9b6e0ea5fdf5fa.mp3","entryId":"31669","definition":"由于身体生病或受伤而疼痛的人。","pronunciation":["환ː자"]},{"id":"c1ee1b7e560f9f3a","term":"어디","zh":"哪里，哪儿","audio":"/audio/c1ee1b7e560f9f3ac3bf.mp3","entryId":"60319","definition":"指代不知道的处所。","pronunciation":["어디"]},{"id":"51f77b0b4a29da93","term":"눕히다","zh":"使躺，使平躺","audio":"/audio/51f77b0b4a29da93a20c.mp3","entryId":"41676","definition":"让人或动物将背部或肋部贴附在某处而横躺下。","pronunciation":["누피다"]}],"audio":"/audio/a37457260b919a7a8d8a.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n41676-1-9-2","ko":"저 방에 자리를 깔아 놓았으니 거기에 눕혀 주세요.","zh":"那个房间里已经铺好床了，请让他/她躺在那里。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"저","meaning":"那","explanation":"저：那","readings":[{"term":"저","audio":"/audio/ac0e9ef613fd92c84845.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71215","senseId":"1","lemma":"저","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"방에","meaning":"房间","explanation":"방：房间；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"방","audio":"/audio/76102fe82462d111be2a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29724","senseId":"1","lemma":"방","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"자리를","meaning":"卧榻之地，床","explanation":"자리：卧榻之地，床；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"자리","audio":"/audio/0f4adfe312e61750897c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"24773","senseId":"3","lemma":"자리","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"깔아","meaning":"铺","explanation":"깔다：铺；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"깔다","audio":"/audio/5c50a6aedfdc736d9252.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"32553","senseId":"1","lemma":"깔다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"놓았으니","meaning":"表示前面所指的行为结束后其结果仍持续。","explanation":"놓다：表示前面所指的行为结束后其结果仍持续。；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；으니：提出原因、依据，或说明经历前一动作后发现的情况。","readings":[{"term":"놓다","audio":"/audio/bac7d20277d64d673e40.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"72578","senseId":"1","lemma":"놓다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"거기에","meaning":"那儿，那里","explanation":"거기：那儿，那里；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"거기","audio":"/audio/8c91c4ef7e321cf67426.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62258","senseId":"2","lemma":"거기","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"눕혀","meaning":"使躺，使平躺","explanation":"눕히다：使躺，使平躺；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"눕히다","audio":"/audio/51f77b0b4a29da93a20c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"41676","senseId":"1","lemma":"눕히다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"주세요.","meaning":"为别人做某事（-아/어 주다）","explanation":"주다：为别人做某事（-아/어 주다）；세요：包含尊敬形式的礼貌句末，可表示请求、劝告或询问等。","readings":[{"term":"주다","audio":"/audio/1b43f195318e9604abd7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"77245","senseId":"1","lemma":"주다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"ac0e9ef613fd92c8","term":"저","zh":"那","audio":"/audio/ac0e9ef613fd92c84845.mp3","entryId":"71215","definition":"用于指示与话者、听者离得很远的对象。","pronunciation":["저"]},{"id":"76102fe82462d111","term":"방","zh":"房间","audio":"/audio/76102fe82462d111be2a.mp3","entryId":"29724","definition":"人为了生活或工作而用墙壁围绕和外界隔绝的空间。","pronunciation":["방"]},{"id":"0f4adfe312e61750","term":"자리","zh":"卧榻之地，床","audio":"/audio/0f4adfe312e61750897c.mp3","entryId":"24773","definition":"为了入睡而使用的被褥。","pronunciation":["자리"]},{"id":"5c50a6aedfdc736d","term":"깔다","zh":"铺","audio":"/audio/5c50a6aedfdc736d9252.mp3","entryId":"32553","definition":"把东西在地面上摊平。","pronunciation":["깔다"]},{"id":"bac7d20277d64d67","term":"놓다","zh":"表示前面所指的行为结束后其结果仍持续。","audio":"/audio/bac7d20277d64d673e40.mp3","entryId":"72578","definition":"表示前面所指的行为结束后其结果仍持续。","pronunciation":["노타"]},{"id":"8c91c4ef7e321cf6","term":"거기","zh":"那儿，那里","audio":"/audio/8c91c4ef7e321cf67426.mp3","entryId":"62258","definition":"指代前面已经讲过的地方。","pronunciation":["거기"]},{"id":"51f77b0b4a29da93","term":"눕히다","zh":"使躺，使平躺","audio":"/audio/51f77b0b4a29da93a20c.mp3","entryId":"41676","definition":"让人或动物将背部或肋部贴附在某处而横躺下。","pronunciation":["누피다"]},{"id":"1b43f195318e9604","term":"주다","zh":"为别人做某事（-아/어 주다）","audio":"/audio/1b43f195318e9604abd7.mp3","entryId":"77245","definition":"为别人做某事（-아/어 주다）","pronunciation":["주다"]}],"audio":"/audio/70d7a10f5360717ada50.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.58,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=41676","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"중급","day":88,"sequenceScore":2.4067,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["那个房间里已经铺好床了，请让他/她躺在那里。","要把病人放在哪里呢？","现在几点？"],"answer":1},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["要把病人放在哪里呢？","现在几点？","那个房间里已经铺好床了，请让他/她躺在那里。"],"answer":2}]}
